   "sourceHash": "840ba8c2767e68339f139c0aa915ae60611caf0a90480ff72ef3e2952eaaa88b",
   "text": "“在健康静修地的6个多月里，我取得了稳步的进展，感谢团队的专业、支持和关怀。”",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
